#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectfilter.rst:14 5ba2472b979f4b339195c56049217e6f
msgid "Low-pass filter effect with adjustable cutoff, slope, gain, and resonance."
msgstr "可调节截止频率、斜率、增益和共振的低通滤波效果器。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectfilter.rst:21 959595e8811d443f92d77a5bf89f469a
msgid ""
"FmodAudioEffectFilter configures one low-pass band in FMOD's MULTIBAND_EQ DSP. It exposes "
"cutoff frequency, slope, gain, and resonance settings. It does not expose high-pass or band-"
"pass modes; use :ref:`FmodAudioEffectEQ<class_FmodAudioEffectEQ>` for those filter types."
msgstr ""
"FmodAudioEffectFilter 配置 FMOD MULTIBAND_EQ DSP "
"中的一个低通频段，并提供截止频率、斜率、增益和共振设置。该类没有高通或带通模式；这些滤波类型可使用  "
":ref:`FmodAudioEffectEQ<class_FmodAudioEffectEQ>` 。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectfilter.rst:23 f057f41f740a45bb8349109b5c1f66b3
msgid ""
"Use this effect to attenuate high frequencies, create muffled audio, or emphasize the cutoff "
"region through resonance."
msgstr "可用于衰减高频、制作沉闷音效，或通过共振突出截止频率附近的声音。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectfilter.rst:106 e4f4a9b0bb434d2f82544aeaf3b321e6
msgid ""
"Compatibility slope option. The current implementation maps this value to the same 24 "
"dB/octave low-pass filter as "
":ref:`FILTER_24DB<class_FmodAudioEffectFilter_constant_FILTER_24DB>`."
msgstr ""
"用于兼容的斜率选项。当前实现将其映射到与  :ref:`FILTER_24DB<class_FmodAudioEffectFilter_constant_FILTER_24DB>`  "
"相同的每倍频程 24 dB 低通滤波器。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectfilter.rst:136 10adabb489154cb89aa870d54541314a
msgid ""
"The low-pass cutoff frequency in Hz, clamped to 1.0 through 20500.0. Frequencies above the "
"cutoff are attenuated."
msgstr "低通截止频率，单位为 Hz，限制在 1.0 到 20500.0。截止频率以上的成分会被衰减。"
